  "description": "Perdido Bay Golf Club was the former site of the Pensacola Open for 10 years, and continues to hold its integrity as a premier championship golf course. Located in Pensacola, FL, less than a 30-minute drive along the gulf from Gulf Shores, AL, Perdido Bay Golf Club is a popular destination for our neighbors to the west in Alabama and the surrounding areas. We are a public golf course and we offer golf club memberships! We were nominated for \"Best New Public Golf Course\" by Golf Digest.",
